UID:2bf23ca24d70c4d9404729e22a4020@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:BAILEN is a songwriting-forward indie pop/folk-rock band that 
 has captivated audiences with its musical dynamism and the three-part "blo
 od harmony" of siblings Julia (guitar)\, Daniel (bass)\, and David (drums)
 . The trio was raised in New York City by two freelance classical musician
 s who steeped them in rock 'n' roll and Brahms. Their close familial bond 
 is evident in their tight-knit musical arrangements and rich\, emotive har
 monies. Currently\, BAILEN is preparing to release its third full-length a
 lbum\, which the band engineered and produced with collaborators Jake Sinc
 lair (Panic! At the Disco)\, Riccardo Damian (Sampha)\, and Chris Tabron (
 the Strokes). The band is excited to release the record fully independentl
 y. Sources: Meet Boston Event page: https://www.meetboston.com/event/baile
 n/91543/\n\nEvents Near Me: within 30 miles of Northborough\, MA 01532\nDi
 scovery: Local fallback from massachusetts-events.ics\nSource page: https:
 //www.meetboston.com/event/bailen/91543/
LOCATION:The Red Room at Cafe 939\, 939 Boylston St\, Boston\, MA\, 02115
URL:https://www.meetboston.com/event/bailen/91543/
