BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Annual DESI Fashion Show
DTSTART:20261113T233000
DTEND:20261114T023000
DTSTAMP:20261113T190134Z
UID:6aef82b3d615faf92121ad8375ccd6@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:Welcome to the annual DESI fashion show! Tonight we will celeb
 rate the evolution of South Asian clothing and culture. South Asia is an i
 ncredibly diverse region influenced by countless cultures that have shaped
  the clothing people wear every day. We hope to highlight designers\, arti
 sans\, and communities from South Asia that are preserving their cultural 
 heritage by keeping traditional textile arts alive while reimagining them 
 for contemporary audiences. Come join us as we journey through the modern 
