BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Family Fun: Holiday Gelato Cake
DTSTART:20261114T000000
DTEND:20261212T000000
DTSTAMP:20261113T190134Z
UID:2d08357f90357860ac397a38aa1866@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:It’s time to get your hands messy! In our hands-on format\, 
 you’ll be diving right in and making our dish with ingredients prepared 
 by our Eataly kitchens. You will then get to enjoy the dish made in advanc
 e by our Scuola Chef\, and you can take your culinary creation home with y
 ou! This delightful twist on the traditional Florentine zuccotto highlight
 s its signature dome shape and rich\, creamy filling. Soft sponge cake is 
 gently brushed with a flavorful syrup—often infused with liqueur or espr
 esso—and then molded to create the classic semicircle. Inside\, you’ll
  layer a luxurious ricotta- or mascarpone‑based cream dotted with chocol
 ate chips or candied fruit for a dessert that is both elegant and comforti
 ng. In this class\, you’ll assemble your own zuccotto using pre‑prepar
 ed components\, learning how to build\, fill\, and finish this iconic Ital
 ian dessert. Sources: Meet Boston Event page: https://www.meetboston.com/e
 vent/family-fun%3a-holiday-gelato-cake/94221/\n\nEvents Near Me: within 30
  miles of Northborough\, MA 01532\nDiscovery: Local fallback from massachu
 setts-events.ics\nSource page: https://www.meetboston.com/event/family-fun
 %3a-holiday-gelato-cake/94221/
LOCATION:Eataly Boston\, Prudential Center 800 Boylston Street\, Boston\, 
 MA\, 02199
URL:https://www.meetboston.com/event/family-fun%3a-holiday-gelato-cake/942
 21/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Fire and Water: Bonnie Cochran and Fred Springer in Concert
DTSTART:20261114T000000
DTEND:20261114T000000
DTSTAMP:20261113T190134Z
UID:f6cfacd746a6419d562ad35c5f813a@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:In Fire and Water\, flutist Bonnie Cochran and guitarist Fred 
 Springer explore the elemental forces that shape both nature and human exp
 erience. Featuring works by Miyagi\, Mahoney\, McFadden\, and Dowland\, th
 e program reflects on fire and water as symbols of creation\, destruction
 \, renewal\, turbulence\, and tranquility. Through shifting musical landsc
 apes\, the concert invites listeners to consider the powerful currents tha
 t flow both around us and within us. Free Admission YouTube: @bonniecochra
 n YouTube: @fspringerguitar This program is supported in part by a grant f
 rom the Marlborough Cultural Council\, a local agency which is supported b
 y the Mass Cultural Council\, a state agency. Sources: Discover Central Ma
 ssachusetts Event page: https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/fire-and-w
 ater%3a-bonnie-cochran-and-fred-springer-in-concert/31165/\n\nEvents Near 
 Me: within 30 miles of Northborough\, MA 01532\nDiscovery: Local fallback 
 from massachusetts-events.ics\nSource page: https://www.discovercentralma.
 org/event/fire-and-water%3a-bonnie-cochran-and-fred-springer-in-concert/31
 165/
LOCATION:Marlborough Public Library\, 35 W Main St.\, Marlborough\, MA\, 0
 1752
URL:https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/fire-and-water%3a-bonnie-cochr
 an-and-fred-springer-in-concert/31165/
END:VEVENT
