 ch of Assumption University’s Civic Friendship Playbook. There will be a
  special meet-and-greet in Pierre’s Pub at 5 p.m.\, featuring Red Sox st
 aff and a rare opportunity to see the historic 2004 World Series trophy up
  close. We will then gather in Curtis Performance Hall for a welcome from 
