BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Student Focus Group on the First-Year Experience
DTSTART:20261117T173000
DTEND:20261117T183000
DTSTAMP:20261113T190134Z
UID:594e1b91b7637cc9192fda138741ae@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:What experiences have shaped the way you think about community
 \, caring for others\, and your role as a member of the Holy Cross communi
 ty? Researchers at the College of the Holy Cross are inviting students to 
 participate in a small-group discussion about the first-year experience. D
 uring this one hour conversation\, you'll have the opportunity to reflect 
 on meaningful experiences\, conversations\, relationships\, and moments th
 at have influenced your time at Holy Cross. We'll explore how your academi
 c\, residential\, and co-curricular experiences have shaped your understan
 ding of community\, responsibility\, and life at the College. Pizza and re
 freshments will be provided. Before You Register Participation in this foc
 us group is entirely voluntary. Before registering\, you will be asked to 
 review and electronically complete an informed consent form. A copy of the
  consent form will automatically be emailed to you for your records. Regis
 tration is available on a first-come\, first-served basis\, and space is l
 imited. We hope you'll join us in helping us better understand the first-y
 ear experience and inform future initiatives that support Holy Cross stude
 nts. --- Event Details: https://myhc.holycross.edu/rsvp?id=2155245 Source:
  College of the Holy Cross Event page: https://myhc.holycross.edu/rsvp?id=
 2155245\n\nEvents Near Me: within 30 miles of Northborough\, MA 01532\nDis
 covery: Local fallback from worcester-colleges-events.ics\nSource page: ht
 tps://myhc.holycross.edu/rsvp?id=2155245
LOCATION:Smith 215\, 1 College Street\, Hogan Campus Center 109\, Worceste
 r\, MA 01610\, United States
URL:https://myhc.holycross.edu/rsvp?id=2155245
END:VEVENT
