BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The "Turn It Down" All-Stars featuring Mowesby presents 'Dark Side
  of the Moon'
DTSTART:20261117T000000
DTEND:20261117T000000
DTSTAMP:20261113T190134Z
UID:31a6544d5eb0c4ce72340459d1579b@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:From this presenter: Can you believe it's our fifth year??? Th
 e "Turn It Down" All-Stars are excited to be returning to the JMAC Brick B
 ox Theater to "turn down" another classic album\, and once again\, all for
  charity. Considering it's our fifth concert\, we decided to go big. This 
 year\, we will acoustify one of the biggest-selling albums of all time\, P
 ink Floyd's timeless (not "Time" less) classic 'Dark Side of the Moon'. Da
 rk Side has sold more than 45 million copies worldwide since its release i
 n 1973. It is a sonic masterpiece\, and the songs are deep\, thoughtful re
 flections on the mental and social state of the modern individual\, and th
 e ever more complex society one must navigate. It is as relevant today as 
 it was 53 years ago. Taking such a big album on with just acoustic instrum
 ents may seem reckless\, and it probably is...but fear not\, we got this! 
 With the help of this year's Featured Artist\, Matt Sowersby aka Mowesby\,
  we will bring you to the Dark Side and back. Per usual\, the show will cl
 ose with a handful of other songs from Pink Floyd's catalogue. (new line) 
 Also\, we are so psyched to be presenting Carlos Odria and Rioflow as our 
 opening act. They are amazing. You won't want to miss a minute! All procee
 ds benefit go to Pernet Family Health Service. -- Follow on Facebook & on 
 IG: @mowesby\, @carlosodriamusic Visit the website: https://mowesby.com/ S
 ources: Discover Central Massachusetts Event page: https://www.discovercen
 tralma.org/event/the-turn-it-down-all-stars-featuring-mowesby-presents-dar
 k-side-of-the-moon/30924/\n\nEvents Near Me: within 30 miles of Northborou
 gh\, MA 01532\nDiscovery: Local fallback from massachusetts-events.ics\nSo
 urce page: https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/the-turn-it-down-all-st
 ars-featuring-mowesby-presents-dark-side-of-the-moon/30924/
LOCATION:Jean McDonough Arts Center\, 20 Franklin St.\, Worcester\, MA\, 0
 1608
URL:https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/the-turn-it-down-all-stars-fea
 turing-mowesby-presents-dark-side-of-the-moon/30924/
END:VEVENT
