BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Family Making: Vintage Coin Jewelry
DTSTART:20261118T000000
DTEND:20261118T000000
DTSTAMP:20261113T190134Z
UID:1cc14ed56387ef06bcf5ab88726a25@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:Let’s transform history into wearable art! In this workshop
 \, you’ll learn how to turn vintage coins into unique pieces of jewelry 
 using basic metalworking techniques. By piercing and drilling a hole for t
 he chains\, you'll create one-of-a-kind accessories with a story. No exper
 ience necessary. Please bring silver or silver-plated coins. Students have
  the option to buy them from our instructor. No experience is required. Pl
 ease wear natural fiber fabrics\, long pants\, and closed-toe shoes. Sourc
 es: Discover Central Massachusetts Event page: https://www.discovercentral
 ma.org/event/family-making%3a-vintage-coin-jewelry/31045/\n\nEvents Near M
 e: within 30 miles of Northborough\, MA 01532\nDiscovery: Local fallback f
