BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:BVCC Hosts 48th Annual Meeting & Awards Ceremony Featuring Keynote
  Speaker Josh Kraft
DTSTART:20261119T000000
DTEND:20261119T000000
DTSTAMP:20261113T190134Z
UID:3cff48fcb2717e2a16558833807550@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:The Blackstone Valley Chamber of Commerce (BVCC) invites membe
 rs\, local business leaders\, community partners and the public to attend 
 its 48th Annual Meeting & Awards Ceremony on Thursday\, November 19\, 2026
 \, at Pleasant Valley Country Club\, 95 Armsby Road\, Sutton. This highly 
 anticipated event\, presented by UniBank\, will celebrate the accomplishme
 nts\, leadership\, and community contributions that continue to strengthen
  the Blackstone Valley. Registration and the breakfast buffet at 7:15AM\, 
 followed by an engaging program at 8:00AM\, and will conclude approximatel
 y at 9:45AM. This year’s Keynote Speaker is Josh Kraft\, host and founde
 r of MassForward\, a new multiplatform civic media initiative designed to 
 spotlight the people\, ideas\, and organizations shaping the future of Mas
 sachusetts. A longtime civic leader and non-profit executive\, Kraft has d
 edicated his career to community development\, youth programs\, re-entry i
 nitiatives\, and strengthening neighborhood across the Commonwealth. Kraft
  previously served as president of the New England Patriots Charitable Fou
 ndation and spent 30 years with the Boys & Girls Clubs of Boston. Drawing 
 on his extensive experience in civic engagement philanthropy\, and communi
 ty leadership\, Kraft will bring a valuable perspective on the people and 
 partnerships that help communities thrive. “Our annual meeting is a wond
 erful opportunity to celebrate the people and businesses who contribute so
  much to our region. Their leadership\, commitment\, and investment in our
  communities are essential to the continued vitality of the Blackstone Val
 ley.” said BVCC President & CEO\, Jeannie Hebert. The Awards Breakfast r
 emains a signature celebration of business excellence and community leader
 ship in the Blackstone Valley. This year’s distinguished honorees includ
 e: Award Winners – 2026 Economic Development Award: Keith Havalotti\, Co
 -Owner\, Blackstone Creamery Community Catalyst Award: Chris Whitten\, Pre
 meer Real Estate Entrepreneurial Spirit Awards: Briana Azier\, Bri’s Swe
 et Treats & Chris Mahoney-Pick\, Stay Awhile Coffee Environmental Stewards
 hip Awards: Nick Socrat\, Douglas Orchard & Farm\, LLC & Betsey Brewer\, E
 ARTH\, Ltd. Gerry Gaudette Extra Mile Award: Denise Brookhouse\, Koopman L
 umber Non-Profit Impact Awards: Mark Mandeville\, Blackstone Valley Music 
 and Performing Arts Collaborative Non-Profit Impact Awards: Heather Elster
 \, Whitin Community Center Volunteer of the Year Award: Kham Inthirath\, C
 EO\, AI Advisor Guy In addition to special recognition awards\, the BVCC w
 ill also honor 15 businesses celebrating milestone anniversaries\, ranging
  from 5 to 200 years in business\, a true testament to the strength and lo
 ngevity of entrepreneurship in the Valley. Members can register for\, $70
 \, Non-Members may register for $80\, and a table of 8 is $500. To registe
 r\, please visit www.blackstonevalley.org/events or scan the QR code on th
 e event flyer. Please RSVP by November 13\, 2026 to secure your seat for t
 his highly anticipated event! For more information\, please contact Kriste
 n Kearnan at (508) 234‑9090 x100 or email kkearnan@blackstonevalley.org.
  Contact October 29\, 2026 For: Immediate Release Kristen Kearnan kkearnan
 @blackstonevalley.org 508-234-9090 Ready to Join? Sources: Discover Centra
 l Massachusetts Event page: https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/bvcc-h
 osts-48th-annual-meeting-%26-awards-ceremony-featuring-keynote-speaker-jos
 h-kraft/31316/\n\nEvents Near Me: within 30 miles of Northborough\, MA 015
 32\nDiscovery: Local fallback from massachusetts-events.ics\nSource page: 
 https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/bvcc-hosts-48th-annual-meeting-%26
 -awards-ceremony-featuring-keynote-speaker-josh-kraft/31316/
LOCATION:Pleasant Valley Country Club\, 95 Armsby Road\, Sutton\, MA\, 015
 90
URL:https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/bvcc-hosts-48th-annual-meeting
 -%26-awards-ceremony-featuring-keynote-speaker-josh-kraft/31316/
